{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124122354357-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124124505\"/><p>執法人員於本月(20日)接獲一名女子報案，指在(19日)晚上在一輛由機場開往東涌的巴士上被一名男子非禮，該名男子其後逃去。</p><p>人員經調查後鎖定疑犯，並於昨日(23日)在屯門區拘捕一名44歲的本地男子，涉嫌「非禮」。被捕人正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:03:58.278671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:23:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:21.241639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:57:20.378338+00:00","content_hash":"e59a181758f07b61fe25e798bc4eb101241e77878f4a71c529f1ddfdae186b46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}